      "estleg:versionText": "1 (1) Põhjavett ohustavad saasteained ning põhjavee keemilise seisundiklassi määramisel kasutatavad nende saasteainete sisalduse läviväärtused põhjaveekogumite kaupa on järgmised: <table class=\"data\"> <tbody><tr> <td><p align=\"center\"><b>Põhjavee-<br/>kogumi<br/>number</b></p></td> <td><p align=\"center\"><b>Põhjaveekogum</b></p></td> <td><p align=\"center\"><b>Saasteaine</b></p></td> <td><p align=\"center\"><b>Ühik</b></p></td> <td><p align=\"center\"><b>Saasteainesisalduse<br/>läviväärtus<br/>põhjavees</b></p></td></tr> <tr> <td><p align=\"center\">1</p></td> <td><p>Kambriumi-Vendi Gdovi</p></td> <td><p>Kloriidid</p></td> <td><p align=\"center\">mg/l</p></td> <td><p align=\"center\">500</p></td></tr> <tr> <td><p align=\"center\">2</p></td> <td><p>Kambriumi-Vendi Voronka</p></td> <td><p>Kloriidid</p></td> <td><p align=\"center\">mg/l</p></td> <td><p align=\"center\">250</p></td></tr> <tr> <td><p align=\"center\">3</p></td> <td><p>Kambriumi-Vendi</p></td> <td><p>Kloriidid</p></td> <td><p align=\"center\">mg/l</p></td> <td><p align=\"center\">250</p></td></tr> <tr> <td><p align=\"center\">4</p></td> <td><p>Ordoviitsiumi-Kambriumi põhjaveekogum Lääne-Eesti vesikonnas</p></td> <td><p>Kloriidid</p></td> <td><p align=\"center\">mg/l</p></td> <td><p align=\"center\">250</p></td></tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"5\"><p align=\"center\">5a</p></td> <td rowspan=\"5\"><p>Ordoviitsiumi-Kambriumi Virumaa põhjaveekogum Ida-Eesti</p></td> <td><p>Sulfaadid</p></td> <td><p align=\"center\">mg/l</p></td> <td><p align=\"center\">100</p></td></tr> <tr> <td><p>Ühealuselised fenoolid</p></td> <td><p align=\"center\">µg/l</p></td> <td><p align=\"center\">1</p></td></tr> <tr> <td><p>Naftasaadused</p></td> <td><p align=\"center\">µg/l</p></td> <td><p align=\"center\">20</p></td></tr> <tr> <td><p>Benseen</p></td> <td><p align=\"center\">µg/l</p></td> <td><p align=\"center\">1</p></td></tr> <tr> <td><p>Summa PAH</p></td> <td><p align=\"center\">µg/l</p></td> <td><p align=\"center\">0,1</p></td></tr> <tr> <td><p align=\"center\">5b</p></td> <td><p>Ordoviitsiumi-Kambriumi Tartu põhjaveekogum Ida-Eesti</p></td> <td><p>Kloriidid</p></td> <td><p align=\"center\">mg/l</p></td> <td><p align=\"center\">350</p></td></tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"5\"><p align=\"center\">6</p></td> <td rowspan=\"5\"><p>Ordoviitsiumi Ida-Viru</p></td> <td><p>Sulfaadid</p></td> <td><p align=\"center\">mg/l</p></td> <td><p align=\"center\">50</p></td></tr> <tr> <td><p>Ühealuselised fenoolid</p></td> <td><p align=\"center\">µg/l</p></td> <td><p align=\"center\">1</p></td></tr> <tr> <td><p>Naftasaadused</p></td> <td><p align=\"center\">µg/l</p></td> <td><p align=\"center\">20</p></td></tr> <tr> <td><p>Benseen</p></td> <td><p align=\"center\">µg/l</p></td> <td><p align=\"center\">1</p></td></tr> <tr> <td><p>Summa PAH</p></td> <td><p align=\"center\">µg/l</p></td> <td><p align=\"center\">0,1</p></td></tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"5\"><p align=\"center\">7</p></td> <td rowspan=\"5\"><p>Ordoviitsiumi Ida-Viru põlevkivibasseini</p></td> <td><p>Sulfaadid</p></td> <td><p align=\"center\">mg/l</p></td> <td><p align=\"center\">250</p></td></tr> <tr> <td><p>Ühealuselised fenoolid</p></td> <td><p align=\"center\">µg/l</p></td> <td><p align=\"center\">1</p></td></tr> <tr> <td><p>Naftasaadused</p></td> <td><p align=\"center\">µg/l</p></td> <td><p align=\"center\">20</p></td></tr> <tr> <td><p>Benseen</p></td> <td><p align=\"center\">µg/l</p></td> <td><p align=\"center\">1</p></td></tr> <tr> <td><p>Summa PAH</p></td> <td><p align=\"center\">µg/l</p></td> <td><p align=\"center\">0,1</p></td></tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"4\"><p align=\"center\">8</p></td> <td rowspan=\"4\"><p>Siluri-Ordoviitsiumi Hiiumaa</p></td> <td><p>Kloriidid</p></td> <td><p align=\"center\">mg/l</p></td> <td><p align=\"center\">250</p></td></tr> <tr> <td><p>Naftasaadused</p></td> <td><p align=\"center\">µg/l</p></td> <td><p align=\"center\">20</p></td></tr> <tr> <td><p>Benseen</p></td> <td><p align=\"center\">µg/l</p></td>